{"id": "t124-054", "text": "Ibrahim - 70th bday Sun 30 Nov. Idris throwing him a lunch at the Turkish place on the high st, 1pm, abt 20 people. I said I'd bring a cake - he likes lemon drizzle not choc, diabetic-ish so maybe a small one. gift: he mentioned his radio broke, a DAB one wd go down well. ask Idris if anyone's already getting that", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th bday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sun 30 Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Idris", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "lemon drizzle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not choc", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "diabetic-ish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "DAB one wd go down well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Idris if anyone's already getting that", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Idris", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
